    "detailed_description": "Space science research theme strategy simulation game, click or drag the mouse to complete all operations.<br><br>Completely different game focus, participate in and experience the research process of aerospace project from the perspective of researchers: recruit personnel, select topics and achieve the final task goal!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Randomly generated characters</h2>Hire employees with different educational backgrounds, different personalities, different regions and different majors to enrich your personnel reserve!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dozens of scientific and technological topics</h2>Assign personnel to carry out topic research, and each successful topic can meet different task indicators!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combine research results</h2>Combine the research results of the topic, install the equipment into the spacecraft and achieve the mission goal - but note that the space in the spacecraft is limited!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Random events</h2>The duration and funds are limited, but may unexpected events happen?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sound Source Announcement</h2>\u7b7e\u5b57\u7b14\u5728\u7eb8\u4e0a\u7b7e\u540d \u8bb8\u53ef:CC0 \u4f5c\u8005:Skipper \u6765\u6e90:\u8033\u8046\u7f51 <br>\u76f8\u673a\u5feb\u95e8\u62cd\u7167 \u8bb8\u53ef:CC0 \u4f5c\u8005:Pole \u6765\u6e90:\u8033\u8046\u7f51 <br>\u6572\u95e8 \u8bb8\u53ef:CC-BY \u4f5c\u8005:kramsttop \u6765\u6e90:\u8033\u8046\u7f51 <br>\u300eFriday Night Lights\u300f CC0\u8bb8\u53ef \u4f5c\u8005\uff1aRKVC \u6765\u6e90\uff1a<br>\u300eTicker\u300f CC0\u8bb8\u53ef \u4f5c\u8005\uff1aSilent Partner \u6765\u6e90\uff1a",
    "about_the_game": "Space science research theme strategy simulation game, click or drag the mouse to complete all operations.<br><br>Completely different game focus, participate in and experience the research process of aerospace project from the perspective of researchers: recruit personnel, select topics and achieve the final task goal!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Randomly generated characters</h2>Hire employees with different educational backgrounds, different personalities, different regions and different majors to enrich your personnel reserve!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dozens of scientific and technological topics</h2>Assign personnel to carry out topic research, and each successful topic can meet different task indicators!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combine research results</h2>Combine the research results of the topic, install the equipment into the spacecraft and achieve the mission goal - but note that the space in the spacecraft is limited!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Random events</h2>The duration and funds are limited, but may unexpected events happen?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sound Source Announcement</h2>\u7b7e\u5b57\u7b14\u5728\u7eb8\u4e0a\u7b7e\u540d \u8bb8\u53ef:CC0 \u4f5c\u8005:Skipper \u6765\u6e90:\u8033\u8046\u7f51 <br>\u76f8\u673a\u5feb\u95e8\u62cd\u7167 \u8bb8\u53ef:CC0 \u4f5c\u8005:Pole \u6765\u6e90:\u8033\u8046\u7f51 <br>\u6572\u95e8 \u8bb8\u53ef:CC-BY \u4f5c\u8005:kramsttop \u6765\u6e90:\u8033\u8046\u7f51 <br>\u300eFriday Night Lights\u300f CC0\u8bb8\u53ef \u4f5c\u8005\uff1aRKVC \u6765\u6e90\uff1a<br>\u300eTicker\u300f CC0\u8bb8\u53ef \u4f5c\u8005\uff1aSilent Partner \u6765\u6e90\uff1a",
